  "worked_solution": "Applying the average value formula, we find that the average value of the function is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{\\text{ave}} & =\\frac{1}{\\text{Area}(D)}\\,{\u222c}_{D}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\u222c}_{D}x+3{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{x}^{x+1}x+3{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}[xy+{y}^{3}]_{y=x}^{y=x+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}[3{x}^{2}+4x+1]\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+x]_{x=0}^{x=2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(18-0) \\\\  & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
